If you look at the latest upstream commit[3]. Which makes changes in the code
and corresponding test that is currently failing.
It fixes something wrt Rmatrix 1.4-2 which I suppose is not backwards compatible with rmatrix versions.
There is r-cran-matrix 1.5-1 uploaded today itself to unstable.

